abstract: >-
  Relativistic Holographic Information Theory (RHIT V9.0) presents an integrated bottom-up effective field theory (EFT) formulated on a 5-dimensional warped geometry S^2 x R_t x [u_IR, 0]. Building directly upon the audited V8.5 baseline (Zero-Contamination Core), RHIT V9.0 preserves all 22 fundamental observables across cosmology, gravity, quark/lepton mass spectra, CKM/PMNS mixing matrices, and CP violation at 15-digit Single Source of Truth (SSOT) precision with combined chi^2 = 1.9421 (dof = 4). Furthermore, V9.0 derives the quartic scalar self-interaction lambda_V9 = 2.750176e-83 and vacuum Thomas-Fermi soliton core radius R_TF,vac = 320.3682 pc directly from 5D geometric invariants, reducing kinematic chi^2 against Local Volume Database (LVDB) Milky Way satellites (N=46) by 40.66% and Local Volume dwarfs (N=94) by 6.30% relative to LambdaCDM NFW profiles, while establishing a falsifiable astrophysical pipeline for M87* superradiant boson cloud resonance (alpha_g = 1.377) and compact-object echoes.
